Description: Construct and inspect dependence-aware cross-validation designs
    for spatial, temporal, spatiotemporal, hierarchical, environmental and
    phylogenetic data. Compact neighbourhood representations distinguish
    observations omitted during fitting from observations assessed, and export
    the structures used by 'mgcv' for neighbourhood cross-validation smoothness
    selection. Optional adapters support 'sf', 'tsibble', 'cubble' and 'rsample'.
